  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Security\n\n- **TLS fixes in the address lookups.** The library that checks certificates for Vortix's public-IP and ISP lookups had four advisories (RUSTSEC-2026-0346 to 0349), and its certificate checker and root store two more (RUSTSEC-2026-0381, 0382). All are updated; nothing changes in how tunnels work. ([#398](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/398), [#400](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/400))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **The dashboard no longer waits 20 s to start when a tunnel's server is unreachable.** With a full tunnel whose server had gone away, DNS went into the dead tunnel and Vortix waited out its timeouts before showing anything; `vortix status` and `vortix down` waited too. A server's last known address is now used after 2 s. ([#399](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/399))\n- **`vortix list` says `1 hour ago` and `1 day ago`,** not `1 hours ago`. ([#389](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/pull/389))\n\n## Install vortix 0.5.5\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n## Download vortix 0.5.5\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | ARM64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/Harry-kp/vortix/releases/download/v0.5.5/vortix-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n",
